        <tr><td><code>sui-stack-spread-{xs|sm|md|lg|full}</code></td><td>How far the hover spread goes (0.15, 0.3, 0.6, 0.85, 1).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>--sui-stack-gap</code></td><td>Distance between spread layers at full spread (default <code>180px</code>); raise it for wider cards, e.g. <code>style="--sui-stack-gap:320px;"</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>--sui-stack-spread</code></td><td>Spread factor set by the <code>sui-stack-spread-*</code> classes.</td></tr>
